# slot outlet of a type this module cannot see

<Panel

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ MarkNode
    is MarkupParent'MarkNode

+ first-child MarkNode?

────────────────────
+ markup-content MarkNode
    - child MarkNode

child

────────────────────
+ do markup-attach-child
    - child MarkNode
    - anchor MarkNode?

first-child = child

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ Panel is MarkNode

────────────────────
+ <Nowhere header

:----
%crash

Exception: Type "Nowhere" not found
<no file:27>
    + <Nowhere header
       ^^^^^^^
;====

