:====
# "each" read where nothing gives an item is named, with what gives one.

+ m ~>
    ~> idle
    ~> busy if each > 1

:----
%crash

Exception: Name "each" not found, as nothing here gives an item; "each" reads the item of a stage, a loop, a callback or a trigger
<no file:4>
        ~> busy if each > 1
                   ^^^^
;====
